            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nHmmm... That's actually a good point. The 'mini.starter' module does the same thing but on `VimEnter`, so 'mini.tabline' still deals with the default value of 'showtabline' at the time of its `setup()` (as I'd recommend to not lazy load it).\n\nI'll take a look if there is a more proper way to do that or just make it more visible that manual `set showtabline=2` is needed if some kind of starter/dashboard plugin is used.",
